    <bpmn:process id="W_W4733" name="W4733. Operational, Resilience &amp; BCP/DR Evidence Collection (RTO/RPO, Substitutes)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New Critical third party; BCP review (VS-26); periodic refresh
Frequency: Per Critical third party + annual
Volume: ~40–60 Critical third parties whose failure would disrupt operations
Owner: TPRM Program Manager (joint with BCP VS-26)
Participants: BCP (VS-26), Supply (VS-02.3), IT/DR (VS-27.2 W55), business owners, the third party
Source: workflow W4733 — Operational, Resilience &amp; BCP/DR Evidence Collection (RTO/RPO, Substitutes)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4733_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4733_Lane1" name="TPRM Program Manager">
