        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4733_Start3" name="New Critical third party; BCP review (VS-26); periodic refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4733_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4733_Task4" name="For each Critical third party, collect operational-resilience &amp; BCP/DR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For each Critical third party, collect operational-resilience &amp; BCP/DR evidence: the third party&#x27;s BCP/DR plan, RTO/RPO, recovery-site, dependency on its own fourth parties (W4724), substitute availability, and recent test results — extends VS-21.2 W1328/W334 enterprise-wide
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / BCP / Supply
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Per Critical third party + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4733_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4733_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4733_Task5" name="Assess whether the third party&#x27;s RTO/RPO meets BuildRight&#x27;s requirements…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assess whether the third party&#x27;s RTO/RPO meets BuildRight&#x27;s requirements (operations continuity, VS-26); require gaps be remediated or compensating resilience (alternate source W4737, safety stock)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / BCP
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / COO
Duration: Per third party</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4733_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4733_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4733_Task6" name="Coordinate resilience testing (joint exercise W4738); integrate third-party BCP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinate resilience testing (joint exercise W4738); integrate third-party BCP into BuildRight&#x27;s BCP (VS-26) and supply-chain disruption response (VS-02.3 W729); retain evidence (VS-88)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / BCP / Supply
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4733_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4733_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4733_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4733_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-714 (ensure controlled execution — Due Diligence, Continuous Monitoring &amp; Evidence Lifecycle (PA-161.2).) | - CTL-714: Critical third-party BCP/DR evidence collected; RTO/RPO meets BuildRight requirements; tested jointly (W4738); extends W1328/W334
Owner: TPRM Program Manager (joint with BCP VS-26)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
