      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Attestation/cert/COI expiry; new requirement
Frequency: Continuous (renewal calendar)
Volume: ~ all attestations/certs/COIs across third parties
Owner: TPRM Program Manager
Participants: Cyber (VS-27.3), Insurance (VS-26), Legal (VS-100.3), Procurement (VS-03), the third parties
Source: workflow W4735 — Attestation, Certification &amp; Insurance (COI) Renewal Tracking Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
