        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the attestation/certification/COI renewal calendar: cyber attestation (W4730), quality/cert (VS-31/VS-117 DTI-BPS), insurance/COI (liability, cyber, workers-comp per VS-26/VS-98), and licenses; alert before expiry
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Domain Owners
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
