        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Collect refreshed attestations/COIs before expiry; review for coverage/scope changes; require remediation for lapsed/expired items; manage contracts that require current attestation/COI
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Cyber / Insurance / Legal
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Per renewal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4735_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4735_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4735_Task6" name="Manage third parties operating with lapsed attestation/COI (suspend…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage third parties operating with lapsed attestation/COI (suspend, risk-accept, or remediate); retain evidence (VS-88); feed lapses into monitoring (W4734) and tiering (W4723)
Responsible (R): TPRM Program Manager / Legal / Insurance
Accountable (A): TPRM Lead / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4735_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
